---
import BaseLayout from "@/components/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteFooter from "@/components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="New ownership" noindex>
  <section class="page-hero shell">
    <div class="page-hero__rail mono">Identity boundary / 2026</div>
    <div class="page-hero__copy">
      <p class="mono signal">New operation / former work remains separate</p>
      <h1 class="display">An old domain. A separate publication.</h1>
      <p>The current Nightmare Mode publication began in 2026 after the domain changed hands. The current operator did not operate the former publication and does not claim its identity.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="boundary shell">
    <h2 class="display">What domain ownership does not transfer</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Former article bodies, artwork, images, comments, feeds, or downloads</li>
      <li>Contributor identities, biographies, customers, communities, or endorsements</li>
      <li>Former logos, private data, unpublished work, or uninterrupted legal identity</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Former operators, authors, and rights holders can use the dedicated correction and rights route. The current publication is responsible only for work clearly dated and credited to the new operation.</p>
    <a class="action action--solid" href="/rights-contact/">Rights and corrections</a>
  </section>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .boundary { padding: var(--section) clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 8rem); border-inline: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { max-width: 10ch; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem); }
  ul { max-width: 58rem; padding: 0; margin-block: 3rem; list-style: none; }
  li { padding: 1rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-family: var(--mono); }
  li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .boundary p { max-width: 48rem; }
  .action { margin-top: 1rem; }
</style>
